WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.737
The ball reaches the outfield.

2
00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:05.369
The whole defense moves to help.

3
00:00:05.849 --> 00:00:08.303
One outfielder gets the ball.

4
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:10.615
A nearby teammate backs up.

5
00:00:11.095 --> 00:00:15.866
The cutoff player becomes a clear target between ball and play.

6
00:00:16.346 --> 00:00:21.202
Make a controlled throw to the cutoff instead of a desperate heave.

7
00:00:21.682 --> 00:00:26.026
For a deeper hit, a relay helps bring the ball back in.

8
00:00:26.682 --> 00:00:28.532
Listen to your teammates.

9
00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:31.389
Get the ball in and protect the bases.
